  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "By bomb calorimeter we get $\\Delta \\mathrm{E}$.\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\r\n2 \\mathrm{C}_{6} \\mathrm{H}_{6}(\\mathrm{l})+15 \\mathrm{O}_{2}(\\mathrm{~g}) \\longrightarrow \\\\\r\n\r\n12 \\mathrm{CO}_{2}(\\mathrm{~g})+6 \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}(1) \\\\\r\n\r\n\\Delta \\mathrm{H}-\\Delta \\mathrm{E}=\\Delta \\mathrm{nRT} \\\\\r\n\r\n=(12-15) \\times 8.314 \\times 300=-7.483 \\mathrm{~kJ}\r\n\r\n\\end{array}\r\n\r\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
